| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| AI/LLM | OpenAI chat completions to the Fairlead router on this PC only (default `http://127.0.0.1:8776/v1/chat/completions`, route `auto`); the address must be loopback; the client key is read from Windows Credential Manager (`Fairlead/Halyard`), never from settings, files or the environment; requests carry `X-Fairlead-Label: Halyard` and, with the privacy setting, `X-Fairlead-Privacy: local` | `src/Halyard.Core/Llm/LlmClient.cs`; key `src/Halyard.Core/Llm/CredentialReader.cs`; settings `src/Halyard.Core/Config/HalyardSettings.cs` | `HALYARD_FAIRLEAD_URL`, `HALYARD_FAIRLEAD_MODEL`, `HALYARD_LLM_PRIVACY`, `HALYARD_LLM_TRANSCRIPTS` |
